# App Detail

::summary
The app detail surface in the shell wrapper — the iOS 8-section idiom (Header, Web, Demo, Code, Deployments, Docs, Tasks, Recent PRs) plus the Android build/deploy section (round 6, 08-19 — target-gated, see the section note) and the F-8 code browser. No action bar; sections carry their own affordances. The Connect-domain and Link-Task sheets live in `modals/` — no inline copies. `height=1800` on the wrapper avoids the clamp clipping the long page.
::

